ligned}6xy-2{y}^{2}-1 \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-4xy+6y\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nStarting with\n${x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={x}_{0}-{[\\begin{aligned}6y & 6x-4y \\\\ 6x-4y & 6-4x\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}}^{-1}{[\\begin{aligned}6xy-2{y}^{2}-1 \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-4xy+6y\\end{aligned}]}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-{[\\begin{aligned}6(0) & 6(2)-4(0) \\\\ 6(2)-4(0) & 6-4(2)\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}6(2)(0)-2(0)^{2}-1 \\\\ 3(2)^{2}-4(2)(0)+6(0)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-{[\\begin{aligned}0 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -2\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-\\frac{1}{0\\cdot (-2)-12\\cdot 12}[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -12 \\\\ -12 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+\\frac{1}{144}[\\begin{aligned}-142 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ≈[\\begin{aligned}1.014 \\\\ 0.083\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380992 13194139536049 true] [17592186380991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380993 13194139536049 true] [17592186380991 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536049 true] [17592186380991 1041 "field-1" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380991 1104 #edb/ref 17592186380993 13194139536049 true] [17592186380991 1110 #uuid "ef2023fc-37ac-54be-a64f-8a630e9eb902" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380992 1034 "0" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380992 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536049 true] [17592186380992 1111 #uuid "3715eb92-5e7c-5d33-aeca-0b8eddd08e6a" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380993 1034 "0.083" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380993 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536049 true] [17592186380993 1111 #uuid "171729a0-cb02-5ba5-bc43-7ad3acfb1520" 13194139536049 true] [17592186380994 1017 #edb/ref 17592186380995 13194139536049 true] [17592186380994 1017 #edb/ref 1